        "id": "mat",
        "text": "Last Sunday, Kangkang and his friends helped at the school library. They arrived at nine o'clock. Ms. Chen, the librarian, asked them to put returned books back on the shelves. Some books were very old, so the students fixed the broken covers with tape. After lunch, they made a list of new books for the reading corner. Kangkang said, \"I never knew that every book has its own number.\" Before going home, they wrote a note on the door: \"Please return books on time!\"",
